      "content": "API for managing and reporting on Brave Ads campaigns. Enables advertisers to retrieve campaign details and performance data for privacy-preserving native browser ads and search ads. Supports customizable reporting dimensions and metrics including impressions, clicks, spend, and conversion tracking. Authentication uses API keys generated from the Brave Ads dashboard.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Brave Ads\n Email: adsales@brave.com",
